# the stick for m48_joymenu.keys (the format is m48_joy.joy's): there
# from the program's start, a little off 570 in both axes, and moved in
# the menu before the battle (the menu's first pass is at 8.1 s, its
# keys from 10 to 19, the battle's first pass near 23)
0 0,560,590,0
# in the menu: down (the next item) and up again (not in the first
# 0.9 s of the menu: the port's first pass is that much behind its
# -start, see docs/HANDOFF.md)
9.20 0,560,1150,0
9.40 0,560,590,0
9.60 0,560,100,0
9.80 0,560,590,0
# behind START, while the battle is set up: held left into the battle's
# first passes
20.00 0,100,590,0
23.60 0,560,590,0
# in the battle: down, the button, right and up at once
25.00 0,560,1150,0
25.60 0,560,590,0
26.00 0,560,590,1
26.30 0,560,590,0
27.00 0,1100,100,0
27.60 0,560,590,0
